{"id":"n4-077","title":"～かもしれない","romaji":"〜kamoshirenai","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Express uncertainty; 'maybe', 'might', 'possibly'.","longExplanation":"The ～かもしれない grammar point is used to express uncertainty or the possibility of something occurring. It can be translated as 'maybe', 'might', or 'possibly' in English. The formation differs depending on whether it is used with a verb, い-adjective, な-adjective, or noun. In everyday speech, speakers often omit だ before かもしれない for nouns and な-adjectives.","formation":"Verb-casual + かもしれない, い-Adjective + かもしれない, な-Adjective + だかもしれない, Noun + だかもしれない","examples":[{"jp":"明日雨が降るかもしれない。","romaji":"Ashita ame ga furu kamoshirenai.","en":"It might rain tomorrow.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"雨が降る","vocabId":"2851949","reading":"あめがふる"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しれる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4]},{"jp":"このケーキは美味しいかもしれない。","romaji":"Kono keeki wa oishii kamoshirenai.","en":"This cake might be delicious.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ケーキ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しい","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しれる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"彼が病気かもしれない。","romaji":"Kare ga byouki kamoshirenai.","en":"He might be sick.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"病気","vocabId":"1490230","reading":"びょうき"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しれる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼女は学生かもしれない。","romaji":"Kanojo wa gakusei kamoshirenai.","en":"She might be a student.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学生","vocabId":"1206900","reading":"がくせい"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しれる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"The everyday hedge for possibility - \"maybe/might\".","family":{"id":"inference","name":"Inference (It Seems / Probably)","relatedPoints":["n4-091","n4-119","n3-118","n4-094","n3-055","n3-126","n3-106","n1-205","n1-207","n2-146"],"axis":"register"},"kind":"construction"}